1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:07,400
Bugun ertalab hayotim oddiy edi. Soat yettida uyg'ondim, choy qo'ydim.

2
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:14,100
Ko'chadan baqiriq eshitilgunga qadar.

3
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:22,400
Birinchi qoida: vahima qilma.

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:29,100
Birinchi o'n daqiqada qilgan qaroring butun kunni hal qiladi.

5
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:37,400
Eshikni qulfla. Chiroqni o'chir. Ovozni pasaytir.

6
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:44,100
Ovoz seni topib beradi.

7
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:52,400
Telefon, powerbank va radioni zaryadla.

8
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:59,100
Aloqa bor paytda oilang bilan qayerda uchrashishni kelishib ol.

9
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:07,400
Suv o'chib qolishi mumkin. Vanna va idishlarni to'ldir.

10
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:14,100
Bir kishiga kuniga kamida uch litr kerak.

11
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:22,400
Tez buzilmaydigan narsalarni yig': konserva, guruch, yong'oq.

12
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:29,100
Muzlatgichdagini birinchi yeb tugat.

13
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:37,400
Ryukzak o'n daqiqada tayyor bo'lsin:

14
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:44,100
dori, hujjat, fonar, batareya, issiq kiyim, suv.

15
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:52,400
Liftdan foydalanma. Chiqish yo'llarini aniqla.

16
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:59,100
Qo'shnilar bilan kelish. Yolg'iz qolma.

17
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:07,400
Uying xavfsiz bo'lsa, birinchi kuni ko'chaga chiqma.

18
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:14,100
Chiqsang, kunduzi, yengil va shovqinsiz chiq.

19
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:22,400
Fonarni pastga qaratib, qopqoq bilan yoq. Derazalarni qora mato bilan yop.

20
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:29,100
Yorug'lik ham ovoz kabi seni ko'rsatadi.

21
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:37,400
Navbatma-navbat uxla. Charchagan miya xato qiladi.

22
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:44,100
Dam olish ham omon qolish qismi.

23
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:52,400
Birinchi kun tugadi. Men hali tirikman.

24
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:59,100
Ikkinchi kunda nima qilish kerakligini keyingi videoda aytaman.
